        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="presentation-grid">

        <!-- Presentation 1 -->
        <article class="presentation-card">

          <img
            src="images/alaska-poster.jpg"
            alt="Vicky Apostolides presenting research on Alaskan proglacial braidplains"
          >

          <div class="presentation-content">

            <p class="presentation-year">2026</p>

            <h3>
              Vegetation Dynamics and Stability of Alaskan Proglacial
              Braidplains
            </h3>

            <p class="authors">
              Apostolides, V., and Armstrong, W.
            </p>

            <p class="venue">
              Undergraduate Research Presentation
            </p>

            <p>
              An analysis of vegetation establishment and landscape change
              across Alaskan proglacial braidplains using Landsat imagery,
              NDVI, NDWI, and multidecadal geospatial analysis.
            </p>

          </div>
        </article>


        <!-- Presentation 2 -->
        <article class="presentation-card">

          <img
            src="images/reu-stream-poster.jpg"
            alt="Research poster about drone-based stream and riparian vegetation assessment"
          >

          <div class="presentation-content">

            <p class="presentation-year">2026</p>

            <h3>
              Drone-Based Assessment of Riparian Vegetation Health
            </h3>

            <p class="authors">
              Apostolides, V., and Sama, M.
            </p>

            <p class="venue">
              University of Kentucky NSF REU Program
            </p>

            <p>
              A methods-focused project combining drone photogrammetry,
              RGB vegetation indices, Random Forest classification, and
              SAM2 segmentation to compare natural and human-impacted streams.
            </p>

          </div>
        </article>


        <!-- Presentation 3 -->
        <article class="presentation-card">

          <img
            src="images/kgs-flood-poster.jpg"
            alt="Research presentation about flood modeling in central Kentucky"
          >

          <div class="presentation-content">

            <p class="presentation-year">2025</p>

            <h3>
              Flood Modeling and Hydrologic Analysis of a Central Kentucky
              Catchment
            </h3>

            <p class="authors">
              Apostolides, V., Swallom, M., et al.
            </p>

            <p class="venue">
              Kentucky Geological Survey Potter Internship
            </p>

            <p>
              A hydrologic study using Mesonet and NOAA data, GIS,
              Python, and TUFLOW to investigate precipitation patterns
              and flood behavior in a central Kentucky catchment.
            </p>

          </div>
        </article>

